#
# g1h (g for goods, 1 is the position, h is the ressource) describes how much holz a building of type p1t and level p1l has cost for building
# g1q describes how much quarry a building of type p1t and level p1l has cost for building
# g1k describes how much kristall a building of type p1t and level p1l has cost for building
# g1w describes how much wein a building of type p1t and level p1l has cost for building
# g1s describes how much schwefel a building of type p1t and level p1l has cost for building

